          "extra_snippets": [
            "13 August 2026 Consulting.us · AArete, a Chicago-based management consultancy, has appointed Pam Shipley as chief executive officer. Shipley, a Fortune 25 healthcare executive with 30+ years of experience, succeeds AArete founder Loren Trimble, who has led the consulting firm for 18 years.",
            "AArete names Michael Davison as chief financial officer AArete, a Chicago-headquartered management and technology consulting firm, has promoted Michael Davison to chief financial officer. 07 August 2024 · More People · HKA hires Brian Reimer as director in government contracting HKA, a risk and disputes consulting firm, has hired Brian Reimer as a director in its government contracting practice in Chicago. 12 August 2026 ·",
            "Shipley has extensive leadership experience across healthcare technology, provider operations, and consulting-driven transformation. She joins AArete from Centene Corporation, a managed care company, where she spent nearly 14 years and was chief strategy officer.",
            "Founded in 2008, AArete provides strategy, profitability improvement, data and analytics, and technology services to clients in healthcare, education, public sector, financial services, retail, technology and professional services, and private equity."
