          "extra_snippets": [
            "August 16, 2026 by Editorial Team · Global consulting firm’s founder Loren Trimble to step down after 18 years of growth and leadership · AArete, a leading global management and technology consulting firm, announced today the appointment of Pam Shipley as chief executive officer.",
            "Over her three-decade career in healthcare, Shipley has built a reputation as an executive who combines deep operational expertise with technology-enabled innovation, including senior leadership roles at Kaiser Permanente and Sharecare spanning healthcare technology, provider operations and consulting-driven transformation. Recognized for her ability to align strategy, technology and operations to drive growth, Shipley brings to AArete a track record of helping organizations navigate complex transformations in highly regulated, technology-driven environments.",
            "Under his leadership, AArete grew into a global firm with more than 500 team members, earning recognition as a Forbes World’s Best Management Consulting Firm for four consecutive years and a USA Today Top Workplaces Award, underscoring the firm’s strong culture and people-first approach.",
            "A Fortune 25 healthcare executive with more than 30 years of experience, Shipley succeeds AArete founder Loren Trimble, who will transition from his role as CEO to board member."
