            "Updated Wed, August 12, 2026 at 2:00 PM UTC · 0 · CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Aug 12, 2026-- AArete, a leading global management and technology consulting firm, announced today the appointment of Pam Shipley as chief executive officer. A Fortune 25 healthcare executive with more than 30 years of experience, Shipley succeeds AArete founder Loren Trimble, who will transition from his role as CEO to board member.",
            "Pam Shipley has been named chief executive officer of AArete, a leading global management and technology consulting firm. A Fortune 25 healthcare executive with more than 30 years of experience, Shipley succeeds AArete founder Loren Trimble, who will transition from his role as CEO to board member.",
            "Shipley joins AArete from Centene Corporation, a leading managed care organization, in which she most recently served as chief strategy officer. She spent nearly 14 years at Centene over two tenures where she held multiple CEO roles in Georgia, Missouri and Mississippi and led digital transformation and market expansion across more than 15 markets.",
            "For more information, visit aarete.com. View source version on businesswire.com:https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260810294659/en/ ... INDUSTRY KEYWORD: TECHNOLOGY RETAIL HEALTH MANUFACTURING CONSULTING SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT PROFESSIONAL SERVICES TRANSPORT SOFTWARE GENERAL HEALTH HARDWARE OTHER MANUFACTURING DATA MANAGEMENT LOGISTICS/SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT ... Copyright Business Wire 2026."
          ]
