          "extra_snippets": [
            "AArete said its approach combines market intelligence, data and technology to help organizations improve profitability, execute digital transformations and manage strategic change. With Shipley at the helm and Trimble remaining on the board, the firm is seeking to build on that platform while expanding its healthcare and technology capabilities. © Copyright 2012 - 2026 | citybiz | Terms of Service | All Rights Reserved",
